<title>JAPAN: Mitsumi Electric - Oct/Mar parent forecast.</title>
<headline>Mitsumi Electric - Oct/Mar parent forecast.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>		   (in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p>			   LATEST	    PREVIOUS	   ACTUAL</p>
<p> (Parent)	     FORECAST	   FORECAST	  YEAR-AGO</p>
<p> Sales		130.00	     117.00	     138.59</p>
<p> Current		6.50		 3.00		 3.37</p>
<p> Net	     prft 3.40	  prft 1.20	  loss 1.91</p>
<p> Ord div	     20.00 yen	   7.00 yen	   5.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Mitsumi Electric Co Ltd makes electronic parts,</p>
<p>especially system components. The forecasts are for the six</p>
<p>month period ending March 31. The actual year-ago figures</p>
<p>are for the eight months to September 30, 1996, because</p>
<p>the company changed its business term.</p>
